  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Hot Drape Forming</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Hot-Drape-Forming.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Operator sets ply stack on tool</li>\n<li>Machine performs hot vacuum drape and debulk</li>\n<li>Three zones for forming, cooling and removal</li>\n<li>All tools stored in overhead area</li>\n<li>Machine automatically retrieves and stores</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Forming / Compaction / Debulking</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-forming-and-trim-cell/\">Stringer Former and Trim Cell</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-i/\">Stringer Former I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-ii/\">Stringer Former II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/stringer-former-iii/\">Stringer Former III</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/hot-drape-forming/\">Hot Drape Forming</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/forming-on-contoured-surfaces/\">Forming on Contoured Surfaces</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/automated-debulking-machine/\">Automated Debulking Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/forming-compaction-debulking/ir-thermoplastic-panel-preheater/\">IR Thermoplastic Panel Preheater</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Hot-Drape-Forming.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Hot-Drape-Forming-300x194.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
